{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\uff01The Easiest Carrier Landing Ever\uff01<br>Simple Flight</i> is a 3D physics-based flight simulator where you can take control of a variety of aircraft \u2014 from fighter jets and passenger planes to helicopters \u2014 and experience the thrill of realistic flight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re soaring through canyons in a precision challenge or completing missions such as transport, rescue, or aerial combat, there\u2019s always something exciting waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Physics Simulation</strong>: Every maneuver is influenced by lift, gravity, and thrust, giving you authentic flight dynamics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Aircraft</strong>: Fly fixed-wing planes, helicopters, and more aircraft types in future updates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freedom of Play</strong>: Explore vast landscapes in free flight mode or put your piloting skills to the test in mission challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Controls</strong>: Supports keyboard, mouse, and controllers for a more authentic piloting experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenges &amp; Missions</strong>: Take on obstacle runs, rescue operations, and combat missions to push your skills to the limit.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a beginner pilot or aiming to become an ace, <i>Simple Flight</i> offers a journey that\u2019s easy to pick up but rewarding to master.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912830/extras/818d7d6b97a591c36a5bad1dea1d5834.avif?t=1770547813\" width=886 height=539 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3912830?t=1770547813